  "description": "Robust Frame For Adults\n\nAluminum frames deliver great performance, rust resistance and weight. Perfect for speed, trails, or commuting, providing absolute control\n\nVersatile 21-Speed Drivetain\n\nEquipped with a 21-speed drivetrain, adult bikes offer a variety of speed options for a flexible riding experience. Easily adjust the gears to suit your preference\n\nSmooth City Commutes\n\nThis adult mountain bike is your reliable companion, ideal for relaxed city commutes and enjoyable rides on easy trails. It transitions seamlessly between city streets and scenic trails\n\nDependable Disc-Brake System\n\nDisc-brakes deliver reliable stopping power, making them easy to maintain and adjust, ideal for beginners learning the fundamentals of brake control in outdoor environments\n\nChoose Ideal Size\n\nTailored for both men and women, the 26\" adult mountain bike fits riders between 5’4’’-5’9’’, while the 27.5\" bike fits riders between 5’8’’-6’5’’, 90% pre-assembly and the tools provided\n\nUnleash your adventure with the Hiland Sedona Mountain Bike. Featuring a lightweight aluminum frame, 21-speed drivetrain, and responsive suspension for smooth trail riding. Shop the ultimate versatile MTB today!",
